<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39520" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulmōnārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Diseased in the lungs</i>, <i>consumptive</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ovis, sus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 5, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 10,
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Beneficial to the lungs</i>, <i>curative of the lungs</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radicula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. 3, 2, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
